{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11411010","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11411010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1141101001:1":{"text":"처음 아르사를 봤을 때 정말 깜짝 놀랐어요! 웬 공 하나가 저 멀리서 데굴데굴 굴러 오는데...","source_cn":"说起来，最开始见到阿尔萨时，我吓了一跳呢！就看到一个球...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6945857B467A9FA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141101002:1":{"text":"맞아요, 정말 놀랐어요. 그 많은 트라이브 중에 아르사만 몸을 공처럼 만드는 것 같던데요?","source_cn":"唔……是呢，这么多蛮血，好像也只见过阿尔萨可以缩成球形。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C90E968CC5D3453","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1141101003:1":{"text":"아... 그게... 음 그건...","source_cn":"啊……这个……这个嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC371A13E917DAA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1141101003":{"text":"아... 그게... 음 그건...","source_cn":"啊……这个……这个嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC371A13E917DAA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141101004:1":{"text":"그것도 맞는 말이긴 해.","source_cn":"这样说倒是也没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF585BDD5B9B2D9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","documen